WEBVTT

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:07.420
We defeated Z-one and stopped Ark Cradle 
from colliding with Neo Domino City.

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:10.660
We were entrusted with the future.

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:15.430
Neo Domino City will travel a new path.

00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:49.960
The Public Maintenance 
Department's role is over.

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:52.360
This city no longer needs authority.

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:56.330
Neo Domino City will
start traveling a new path.

00:00:56.930 --> 00:00:58.700
Move outta the way!

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.800
Your head is in the way!

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:10.330
Ahem.

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:13.530
We are dissolving the 
Public Maintenance Department

00:01:13.530 --> 00:01:16.190
and inaugurating a new
mayoral organization.

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:23.890
I am Yeager. You elected me as
 Neo Domino City's first mayor.

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:29.350
Thank you.

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:31.900
I have a dream!

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:40.280
Haruka, you're incredible.

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:43.020
You'll be able to leave 
earlier than scheduled.

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:44.080
Really?

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:45.180
Haruka!

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:46.880
Aki!

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:49.630
Haruka, you're going to be discharged?

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:50.680
Congratulations!

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:54.360
It's because you're always 
cheering me on.

00:01:55.990 --> 00:01:59.090
You should thank the doctor instead of me.

00:02:00.230 --> 00:02:01.560
Thank you, Doctor!

00:02:02.710 --> 00:02:04.300
Haruka, you worked hard.

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:10.100
Aki, what are you going 
to do after you graduate?

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:15.410
Since you're #1 in Duel Academy, you'll 
obviously be a pro duelist, right?

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:17.270
Well...

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:19.660
I don't know yet.

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:26.590
If you think you can stop 
Dobocle, go ahead and try!

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:28.120
Noble Stream!

00:02:35.660 --> 00:02:39.800
You can't drive that D-Wheel!

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:41.900
It's been illegally modded!

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:45.880
Well, today is the inauguration 
of the new mayor.

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:47.640
So I'll let you off with a warning.

00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:56.180
Yeager is the mayor.

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:57.870
I'm surprised.

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:02.430
But not as surprising as me
 becoming a highway patrolman.

00:03:02.430 --> 00:03:09.260
Should Crow Hogan, the conqueror 
of the WRGP, be living in obscurity?

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:10.660
You again.

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:12.030
Yes.

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:15.000
I will follow you to the depths of hell.

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:21.880
Preparing to activate Moment.

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:25.680
Inside the cylinder, Yusei Particles
have increased to 86%.

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:27.420
System check.

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:31.380
ACB and ACC at each point
functioning normally.

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:34.540
Network translator all clear.

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:38.570
Riding Duels.

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:41.730
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:48.310
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:56.350
Run! The road of evolution leading to tomorrow

00:03:56.350 --> 00:04:00.890
Is a new legendary duel

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:17.850
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:23.470
Set free your infinite potential

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:29.080
Every beginning is up to you

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:35.680
Everyone is lost Pursue the light

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:40.990
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:46.560
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:54.410
Become the gale and dance Cut through the darkness

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:59.610
Even if you can't see your destination

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:05.080
Run on your feet without fear

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:10.950
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:18.480
Going my way!! Break through and go!

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:37.740
The Ideal Future

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:39.940
Ready to activate Moment.

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:41.350
Activating.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:47.070
Moment operating normally.

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:49.380
Energy conduction system normal.

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:51.850
Chief, the final code.

00:05:57.030 --> 00:05:59.720
Activating mainframe “Fortune.”

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:01.600
Program check.  Normal.

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:03.230
No virus infection.

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:05.000
Related systems all clear.

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:07.470
Congratulations, Chief.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:09.900
The mainframe “Fortune” is completed!

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:24.360
Congratulations, Professor Fudo.

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:26.320
Stop with the "Professor."

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:27.550
I'm not one.

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:32.290
No, I'm sure you will surpass 
your father in the near future.

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:37.260
Thanks to Fortune, Neo Domino 
City's lifelines are all unified,

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:42.150
and the city's functions will 
be led properly.

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:47.740
It connects to cities around the world, 
and Neo Domino City will act as a leader.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:48.890
Yeah.

00:06:48.890 --> 00:06:52.840
We won't head towards the future 
of destruction that Z-one mentioned.

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:54.550
It's all thanks to you.

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:58.000
It's because everyone helped me.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:06:59.750
It was a good team.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:03.990
"Team." You would say that.

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:08.300
You once told me that there's 
no such thing as a useless person.

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:14.430
Your conviction freed Neo Domino 
City from Iliaster's curse.

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:18.600
Now this city can get
true freedom back.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:20.400
That's what I'm hoping for.

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:24.150
Sorry to rush you into completing this.

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:26.410
I won't ask for too much anymore.

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:28.930
Please take a break.

00:07:28.930 --> 00:07:31.980
Travel the path to
your own ideal future.

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:39.460
But to be honest, I want you 
to stay in Neo Domino City.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:42.040
I'm sorry.

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:43.320
I've said too much.

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:45.500
I'll take my leave.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:51.980
What is it?

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:55.100
Chief, Crow is callling you.

00:07:55.440 --> 00:07:56.810
Thank you.

00:08:02.840 --> 00:08:04.330
Hey, Yusei!

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:07.280
I need to go through a 
receptionist to call you?

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:10.320
How annoying. Were you busy?

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:11.600
Sorta.

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:14.200
But the mainframe has finally been completed.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:15.610
You did it, Yusei!

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:16.790
Congratulations!

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:18.960
How are things with you?

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:24.110
Ushio works me hard every day, 
so I'm always supervising.

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:25.630
I don't have time to sleep.

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:29.240
To think that someone with 
a Marker would be a supervisor.

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:31.270
This city has completely changed.

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.880
No, we changed it.

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:36.240
We're going to create the future.

00:08:36.630 --> 00:08:37.640
You're right.

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:41.980
We're going to create the future 
with a bond called Team 5D's.

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:45.320
Crow, what is it?

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:48.970
It's nothing.

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:51.910
Didn't you call me because 
you needed something?

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:57.130
Well... We haven't met in a while,
so I just wanted to see how you're doing.

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:01.320
Crow, why don't we
all get together?

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:03.170
Let's eat together this weekend.

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:04.700
That's a good idea!

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:06.000
I'll ask around.

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:08.140
But there's one person who's a problem.

00:09:08.140 --> 00:09:11.610
Jack. You still can't 
get in contact with him?

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:14.520
Where is he?

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:20.550
I'll send him an email, but does 
he even understand our bond?

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:30.460
I can't believe your dueling 
has evolved this much.

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:41.020
Impressive.

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:43.230
You had no weaknesses to exploit.

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:44.240
I completely lost.

00:09:55.270 --> 00:09:56.750
You've become strong.

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:05.160
But by the look on your 
face, you're not satisfied.

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:08.370
No, not yet.

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:11.740
There is still someone I must battle.

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:25.390
Luca, hurry up and get ready!

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:27.600
We're going to be late!

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:29.200
Sheesh, wait!

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:32.710
Since we all haven't met in a while,
I want to dress nicely!

00:10:36.050 --> 00:10:37.900
Not bad!

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:38.600
Really?

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:43.060
We have to hurry!

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:50.540
We have mail.

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:52.830
It's Mama and Papa!

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:53.600
Really?

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:56.220
What's this?

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:57.800
What should we do, Lua?

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.120
Sheesh.

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:01.630
They're sending something 
this important via email?

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:03.520
They never change.

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:05.530
I'll call them.

00:11:05.530 --> 00:11:07.720
What are they thinking?

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:16.270
Yes, I see.

00:11:17.140 --> 00:11:20.250
I can study abroad without 
waiting for graduation.

00:11:20.690 --> 00:11:21.380
Yes.

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:23.780
Right now?

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:29.150
I understand. Yes.

00:12:23.830 --> 00:12:28.730
Yusei!

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:36.890
Yusei!

00:12:36.890 --> 00:12:38.640
Sorry we're late.

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:42.000
Aki, Lua, Luca.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:43.180
It's been awhile.

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:46.670
Aww, I'm late.

00:12:46.670 --> 00:12:48.780
Crow, you're late!

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:50.160
Everyone was waiting for you!

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:51.640
Sorry!

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:54.380
We're joking.

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:56.960
We haven't started yet.

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:02.160
Yeah, I feel it.

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:08.690
Our work is needed for the people 
of Neo Domino City and for duelists.

00:13:08.690 --> 00:13:10.150
The job is worth doing.

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:11.580
However...

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:14.050
However what?

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:15.510
Well...

00:13:16.050 --> 00:13:17.100
Umm...

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:21.260
So Aki, what are you going 
to do when you graduate?

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:25.390
Since you're elite, you'll be in 
high demand from all the leagues.

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:28.630
Why does everyone say that?

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:32.300
Don't choose my future for me!

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:34.630
Why are you so touchy, Aki?

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:35.820
I'm not!

00:13:35.820 --> 00:13:37.470
You're the one who's
acting up, Crow!

00:13:37.470 --> 00:13:39.340
You keep saying the same thing!

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:40.590
What?

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:43.140
You talk about what's worth 
doing, but you're just complaining!

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:46.110
We received an email today.

00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:48.560
From Papa and Mama.

00:13:48.560 --> 00:13:50.280
Saying that we should live together.

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:51.960
That's good!

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:54.080
A family has to be together.

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:58.050
But we'll have to leave Neo Domino City.

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:00.040
I see.

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:02.030
Lua... Luca...

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:06.670
We haven't decided yet, but we're 
wondering what we should do.

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:09.280
Because we want to stay 
together with everyone.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:11.900
We don't want to leave Neo Domino City.

00:14:12.420 --> 00:14:14.500
But we don't know...

00:14:20.070 --> 00:14:23.870
Crow and Aki, you two are 
also wondering what to do.

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:27.980
Crow, you received an offer 
from an overseas pro league.

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:31.780
Aki is about studying abroad 
at a medical university.

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:33.660
How did you know?

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:37.740
Your parents asked me 
to discuss it with you.

00:14:38.320 --> 00:14:41.130
Aki, you're going to be a doctor?

00:14:43.030 --> 00:14:45.370
But I'm confused.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:56.720
Jack?

00:14:56.720 --> 00:14:57.830
Jack?

00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:00.060
Jack.

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:02.480
Where have you been?

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:03.950
Traveling and training.

00:15:04.440 --> 00:15:06.120
Traveling and training?

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:11.830
I've decided to leave Neo Domino City.

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:18.860
I've received an invitation from Ride Ace, 
the world's greatest duel league.

00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:21.200
I will become King of the world!

00:15:21.570 --> 00:15:23.020
King?

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:24.810
You're still talking about that?

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:26.940
What about our bond?

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:30.280
You're still relying on our bond?

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:35.770
Don't you want to test your 
skills against the world?

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:41.550
Yusei, you must have also
 received an invitation.

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:43.260
Yeah.

00:15:43.840 --> 00:15:45.640
Of course you did.

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:50.730
Since even I get an invitation, Yusei 
would be invited by every league.

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:54.670
Yusei, what are you going to do?

00:15:55.300 --> 00:16:01.000
Now that the mainframe is complete,
I'm also confused about what to do next.

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:06.280
I-We have accomplished everything 
we could do as a team.

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:11.120
So what I should do next is create 
my own future by myself!

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:15.250
I want to test my power against the world!

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:22.930
I will eliminate anything that stands 
in my way, even if it's Team 5D's bond!

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:29.630
Jack, we're confused 
because we can't do that.

00:16:32.960 --> 00:16:35.310
Jack, duel me.

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:39.880
You want to duel me?

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:43.250
Dueling has always guided us.

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:48.380
Since we're confused, we should 
find the answer by dueling.

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:54.060
I look forward to it because I must 
defeat you before taking on the world!

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:14.440
Yusei and Jack are about to battle.

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:21.380
I've seen them battle many times since I 
was a kid, so why am I shaking?

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:25.860
Jack, this is the first time we're dueling 
 each other since the Fortune Cup.

00:17:25.860 --> 00:17:29.750
Yeah. Many things have happened since then.

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:34.480
I can't believe I had to fight by your 
side against many enemies.

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:37.800
Yeah, but it was fun for me.

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:39.480
Me too.

00:17:39.480 --> 00:17:44.720
But I've been looking forward
to dueling you again.

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:49.280
My heart may have been
thinking the same thing.

00:17:49.760 --> 00:17:53.010
Nothing will interfere
with our duel anymore.

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:54.070
Yeah.

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:57.990
I'll give it my all in this duel!

00:17:58.290 --> 00:17:59.440
Of course.

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:01.960
I will also strike you
with everything I have!

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:06.960
My soul is completely about dueling!

00:18:08.930 --> 00:18:11.030
Speed World 2 set!

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:12.200
Duel Mode on.

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:14.090
Riding Duel!

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:16.370
Acceleration!

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:18.840
Whoever takes the first corner goes first!

00:18:21.760 --> 00:18:22.510
I won't let you!

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:28.380
I'll go first!

00:18:29.320 --> 00:18:30.350
I'll let you have it.

00:18:32.850 --> 00:18:33.920
Lane selection...

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:36.320
Searching for optimal lane...

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:38.780
Sending duel lane request to Central.

00:18:39.600 --> 00:18:40.790
Authorization!

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:44.160
A duel is about to begin.

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:47.480
Normal vehicles must leave
the route immediately.

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:49.970
A duel is about to begin.

00:18:50.590 --> 00:18:53.290
Normal vehicles must leave
the route immediately.

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:56.540
My turn!

00:18:57.120 --> 00:19:00.550
I summon the Tuner Monster 
Blue Expense Falcon!

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:08.480
He already summoned a Tuner Monster.

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:10.520
He's using full strength from the start.

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:14.320
When Blue Expense Falcon 
is successfully summoned,

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:19.500
I can Special Summon one Level 4-or-below 
Dragon-Type monster from my hand.

00:19:19.920 --> 00:19:22.200
I Special Summon Bright Star Dragon!

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:31.220
When Bright Star Dragon is Special Summoned,
one monster's Level increases by 2.

00:19:32.550 --> 00:19:35.620
Blue Expense Falcon's Level 
increases from 2 to 4!

00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:42.290
Level 4 Blue Expense Falcon tunes 
Level 4 Bright Star Dragon!

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:48.340
The wishes come together to 
form a new shining star!

00:19:48.340 --> 00:19:50.030
Become the path that lights the way!

00:19:51.140 --> 00:19:52.300
Synchro Summon!

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:55.570
Soar, Stardust Dragon!

00:19:57.680 --> 00:20:00.240
I set one card and end my turn!

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:01.580
Incredible!

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:03.440
A Stardust Dragon already?

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:05.140
My turn!

00:20:06.440 --> 00:20:09.910
When there's a Synchro Monster on your field,

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:14.620
I can Special Summon the Tuner Monster 
Synchron Resonator from my hand!

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:20.890
Next, I summon Star Gatherer!

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:28.460
Star Gatherer's Level becomes the same
 as your Synchro Monster minus 1.

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:31.110
Therefore, Star Gatherer is Level 7!

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:37.310
Level 1 Synchron Resonator 
tunes Level 7 Star Gatherer!

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:41.080
The pulse of the King now forms a line here!

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:43.420
Witness the power of the rumbling heavens!

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:45.250
Synchro Summon!

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:49.320
My soul! Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:54.430
He used Stardust Dragon's Level 
to bring out Red Dragon Archfiend.

00:20:54.430 --> 00:20:57.430
Their ace monsters are
already about to clash.

00:21:02.630 --> 00:21:04.720
I won't hold back, Yusei!

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:08.870
Red Dragon Archfiend 
attacks Stardust Dragon!

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:11.370
Absolute Powerforce!

00:21:11.920 --> 00:21:14.610
I activate the trap Star Excursion!

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:19.280
When Synchro Monsters battle, both 
monsters are removed from play,

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:24.250
and they're Special Summoned at
the end of your third turn's Battle Phase!

00:21:25.460 --> 00:21:28.820
Stardust Dragon and Red 
Dragon Archfiend vanished.

00:21:28.820 --> 00:21:32.190
Yeah. They both vanished 
into our futures.

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:33.660
Future?

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:36.100
Future?

00:21:37.840 --> 00:21:39.010
That's right!

00:21:39.010 --> 00:21:42.300
I will find my future in this duel!

00:22:06.070 --> 00:22:11.200
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:11.440 --> 00:22:16.570
If we shed the same tears, let's laugh together

00:22:16.570 --> 00:22:21.940
Freed reality forms phrases in the piercing beat

00:22:21.940 --> 00:22:24.720
Our hearts resonate

00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:29.920
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:29.920 --> 00:22:36.530
We'll find a place for us

00:22:38.390 --> 00:22:43.640
Waking in a dream Stretch our hands toward the future

00:22:43.640 --> 00:22:48.670
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:49.130 --> 00:22:54.850
Repaint the darkness with the colors we envision

00:22:54.850 --> 00:23:03.150
Overlaying memories, bonds and hope creates future color

00:23:03.150 --> 00:23:09.060
We will draw it forever
